Cell["\<\

Metric functions for Kerr spacetime, \[CapitalDelta][r] and \
\[CapitalSigma][r, \[Theta]]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9973340535139685`*^9, 3.997334078763514*^9}, 
   3.997334113312686*^9, {3.997405092691093*^9, 
